==Trivia==
*"Sleeping Lion" (眠れる獅子 ''Nemureru Shishi'') is a term first used  as a name for China during the [[wikipedia:First Sino-Japanese war|First Sino-Japanese War]]; it is currently used to describe a person or country that has great potential or power but has yet to demonstrate it. In this context, it would refer to [[Doge]], who didn't get to show his true power until he found a recruitment flyer and became [[Doge Dark]], or the enemy base, which doesn't spawn the Doge Darks until its HP falls to 50%.

